# Grave Researcher: "At the beginning of your upkeep, surveil 1. Then if there are three or more creature cards in your graveyard,
# this creature becomes prepared" (CR 701.25, 603.4, 722.3a). Turn 1 Bot1 Bolts its own Ornithopter (one creature card in the
# graveyard). Turn 3's surveil puts an Ornithopter there too: two, not prepared. Turn 5's surveil puts a Grizzly Bears there:
# three - the count is taken after the surveil - so it becomes prepared, a Reanimate copy in exile. Casting that copy (CR 722.3c)
# returns the Bears under Bot1's control for 2 life, unprepares the Researcher and takes the copy with it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grave Researcher
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island
Ornithopter
Island
Grizzly Bears
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

